HeOCR OCR worker images
=======================

These images provide infrastructure for comparison and training.

Kraken and TrOCR images contain non-open-source but redistributable components:

* Intel(R) oneAPI Math Kernel Library (oneMKL), bundled in the Linux AMD64
  PyTorch 2.14.0+cpu wheel. Copyright (c) Intel Corporation.
  Intel Simplified Software License (ISSL):
  https://www.intel.com/content/dam/develop/external/us/en/documents/pdf/intel-simplified-software-license.pdf
  Intel's redistribution guidance:
  https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/developer/articles/tool/onemkl-license-faq.html
  A copy of the ISSL is included alongside this notice in those images.

See the upstream dependency notices shipped with the installed packages.
